  ('70250f64-2de0-58ff-b9b5-d51866695f91', '28bf97dd-52f2-5477-992b-ce314072a8fb', '662d00c3-013a-5a35-98a2-939cf4b3364f', 'H&S Manager', 'Owns the site''s health & safety policy, risk management and compliance programme, leading the H&S Advisor team and acting as the site''s technical authority on safety matters.', 'Develop, implement and maintain the site''s health & safety policy, risk assessments and safe systems of work.
