Champion a proactive, no-blame safety culture that encourages near-miss and hazard reporting.', 23.08, 'management', 'salaried'),
  ('763aef29-10a4-51fc-bf4f-d655b8dd9dd0', '28bf97dd-52f2-5477-992b-ce314072a8fb', '662d00c3-013a-5a35-98a2-939cf4b3364f', 'H&S Advisor', 'Supports day-to-day safety compliance across the site through inspections, inductions and investigation support, acting as a visible and approachable safety resource for the workforce.', 'Carry out routine safety walks, workplace inspections and risk assessments across production and support areas.
