  ('70f25fbe-e2a5-5a81-8f86-c5202aec0326', '28bf97dd-52f2-5477-992b-ce314072a8fb', 'd24069f1-e191-5396-9d14-a2c765149e2c', 'Quality Manager', 'Accountable for the site''s Quality Management System, acting as technical authority on product quality and food safety, and leading the Quality Supervisor and Technician team.', 'Own and continuously develop the site''s Quality Management System in line with ISO 9001/22000 and customer requirements.
