  ('6e13110d-864f-590b-8d4e-060f048a6812', '28bf97dd-52f2-5477-992b-ce314072a8fb', 'd24069f1-e191-5396-9d14-a2c765149e2c', 'Quality Supervisor', 'Leads quality inspection activity across an assigned shift, supervising technicians and acting as the first point of escalation for quality issues on the floor.', 'Supervise Quality Technicians across an assigned shift, ensuring inspection schedules are completed accurately and on time.
