  ('cc9920df-8511-5869-be21-ae0f3dff7d3d', 'Significant senior leadership experience at site or business-unit level within a regulated manufacturing environment is essential; a relevant degree and/or MBA is desirable.', ARRAY['Overall site safety, quality, service and cost performance against the annual plan','Delivery of the site''s strategic and capital investment priorities']),
  ('13c16c54-8351-5c0a-8731-776f1401ce42', 'A proven track record leading multi-disciplinary operational teams in a 24/7 manufacturing environment is essential; Lean/Six Sigma exposure is desirable.', ARRAY['Combined OEE and manning attainment across Production, Engineering, Quality and Hygiene','Cross-functional escalation resolution time']),
  ('70250f64-2de0-58ff-b9b5-d51866695f91', 'NEBOSH National General Certificate essential; NEBOSH Diploma (or equivalent) and experience in a food/FMCG manufacturing environment is desirable.', ARRAY['Lost-time accident frequency rate and near-miss reporting rate','Safety audit and corrective action closure rate']),
