  ('70f25fbe-e2a5-5a81-8f86-c5202aec0326', 'HACCP Level 3 and a lead internal auditor qualification essential; a degree in food science, microbiology or a related discipline is desirable.', ARRAY['Customer complaint rate and corrective action closure time','Audit non-conformance rate across internal, customer and certification audits']),
